            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.21.1+JOS.21.2+JOS.21.3+JOS.21.4+JOS.21.5+JOS.21.6+JOS.21.7+JOS.21.8+JOS.21.9+JOS.21.10+JOS.21.11+JOS.21.12+JOS.21.13+JOS.21.14+JOS.21.15+JOS.21.16+JOS.21.17+JOS.21.18+JOS.21.19+JOS.21.20+JOS.21.21+JOS.21.22+JOS.21.23+JOS.21.24+JOS.21.25+JOS.21.26+JOS.21.27+JOS.21.28+JOS.21.29+JOS.21.30+JOS.21.31+JOS.21.32+JOS.21.33+JOS.21.34+JOS.21.35+JOS.21.36+JOS.21.37+JOS.21.38+JOS.21.39+JOS.21.40+JOS.21.41+JOS.21.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joshuwa 21:1–42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achigomba na Musa kahi ya tsi ya kugbwa ya Moabu iriyo kanda-kanda ya muho Joridani, ngʼambo ya phiri napho ula Jeriko achimuamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alagize Aiziraeli aaphe Alawi midzi ya kusagala kahi ya tsi ndiyokala yao, phamwenga na seemu zozunguluka yo midzi ikale mwatu mwa kurisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo midzi indakala yao, nao andasagala mumo, namo mundakala na mwatu mwao mwa kurisa mifugo yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Pho phatu pha kurisa mundiphoapha Alawi ni phakale phana ure wa mita magana mane na mirongo mitsano kula ukuta wa mudzi, kuzunguluka pande zosi za chila mudzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ko kondze ya nyo mudzi mundapima mita magana tisiya uphande wa mlairo wa dzuwa, mita magana tisiya uphande wa mtswerero wa dzuwa, mita magana tisiya uphande wa vurini, na mita magana tisiya uphande wa mwakani, kuzunguluka nyo mudzi. Hipho phandakala phatu phao pha kurisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Midzi sita kahi ya yo midzi mundiyoipha Alawi indakala midzi ya kuchimbirira, ambayo mutu ndiyeolaga myawe bila kumanya andachimbirira. Chisha mundaenjereza midzi yanjina mirongo mine na miiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa jumula ni muaphe Alawi midzi mirongo mine na nane phamwenga na phatu pha kurisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Midzi ambayo mundaipha Alawi kula tsi ndiyohalwa ni Aiziraeli indalaviwa kulengana na urisi wa chila mbari. Kula mbari iriyo na midzi minji, mundahala midzi minji na kula mbari iriyo na midzi michache mundahala michache.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
