              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Msikubali kuphokera kore kpwa ajili ya mutu achiyechimbirira mudzi wa kuchimbirira ili mumuruhusu auye kpwao kabila ya ye mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu kufwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
